{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Wrinkle Your Brain  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Times Trials is an all-ages, arcade-style block-dropping puzzle game that will supercharge your math skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/combo_add_10.gif?t=1749637350\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal is simple: arrange the falling number blocks to form rows or columns that equal the target number. As the blocks keep falling, you\u2019ll need lightning-quick thinking to make it through. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Much Math. Many Puzzles. Wow</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race against the clock in timed mode or go head-to-head against friends in versus battles. Choose from four operations: addition, subtraction, multiplication, or division. Play them across over 30 different levels and 3 game modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/timestrials_hexagon_mode.gif?t=1749637350\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game caters to all skill levels, making it a perfect choice for students and math enthusiasts alike. Whether you\u2019re a beginner looking for a fun way to practice or a pro looking for a challenge, Times Trials is right for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">School Your Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiply the fun with multiplayer! Versus mode lets you show off your cool math skills.\u00a0<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/multiplayer_combo_Win.gif?t=1749637350\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cute Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/times_trials_character_select.gif?t=1749637350\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Made by Excellent People</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Times Trials has had the honor to have industry veterans be a part of the development. These veterans have come from titles such as Mickey Mouse Funhouse, beatmania IIDX, and Deemo II.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2351640?t=1749637350","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2351640?t=1749637350","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749637350","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749637350","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2646140,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Wrinkle Your Brain  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Times Trials is an all-ages, arcade-style block-dropping puzzle game that will supercharge your math skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/combo_add_10.gif?t=1749637350\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal is simple: arrange the falling number blocks to form rows or columns that equal the target number. As the blocks keep falling, you\u2019ll need lightning-quick thinking to make it through. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Much Math. Many Puzzles. Wow</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race against the clock in timed mode or go head-to-head against friends in versus battles. Choose from four operations: addition, subtraction, multiplication, or division. Play them across over 30 different levels and 3 game modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/timestrials_hexagon_mode.gif?t=1749637350\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game caters to all skill levels, making it a perfect choice for students and math enthusiasts alike. Whether you\u2019re a beginner looking for a fun way to practice or a pro looking for a challenge, Times Trials is right for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">School Your Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiply the fun with multiplayer! Versus mode lets you show off your cool math skills.\u00a0<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/multiplayer_combo_Win.gif?t=1749637350\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cute Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/times_trials_character_select.gif?t=1749637350\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Made by Excellent People</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Times Trials has had the honor to have industry veterans be a part of the development. These veterans have come from titles such as Mickey Mouse Funhouse, beatmania IIDX, and Deemo II.</p>","developers":["Arc-Fy"],"dlc":[2646100],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap